============================================================
README file for $(corelib)/progs/students/xinwei

Core Library (since version 2.1, March 2012)
============================================================

Description:
	This directory has various subdirectoris containing algorithms
	for robotics, especially motion planning.

	This is a 3-view demo showing how an object of 2 degrees of freedom in
	rotation mapping the physical rotation vector (theta, phi) to a cubic
	form rotation vector (x, y, z) which can later apply subvision on.

Author:
	Xinwei Lin (2013).

$Id: README $
============================================================
Files:
	README		-- this file

Directories:
	K_5/objectModel.txt, objectM2.txt	-- Models of varied
						objects to show rotations
	K-5		-- the demo

